# Health — liveness probe (v1-plan.md Section 7.1)

### GET /health — success
GET {{baseUrl}}/health

> {%
client.test('200 with ok envelope', function () {
  client.assert(response.status === 200, 'expected 200');
  client.assert(response.body.data.status === 'ok', 'expected data.status ok');
});
%}

### Unknown path — 404 envelope
GET {{baseUrl}}/no-such-resource

> {%
client.test('404 with error envelope', function () {
  client.assert(response.status === 404, 'expected 404');
  client.assert(response.body.error.message === 'Not found', 'expected Not found');
});
%}
